格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Universal Model Context Protocol (MCP) Bridge Plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — Everything is a Plugin","id":"gh:1342217251","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-mcp","slug":"menotbobbybrown/dsh-plugin-mcp","topics":["ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp","model-context-protocol"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Universal Model Context Protocol (MCP) Bridge Plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — Everything is a Pl"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ersal Model Context Protocol (MCP) Bridge Plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — Everything is a Plugin"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-mcp"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Universal Model Context Protocol (MCP) Bridge Plugin for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`)**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-plugin-mcp` is an official-standard plugin for DeepSeek Harness that seamlessly connects your D"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"eepSeek agents to the entire ecosystem of Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers with full Claude Code"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"-level feature parity."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"See our complete ROADMAP.md for current features and upcoming milestones."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- 🔌 **Universal MCP Support**: Run any MCP server over `stdio`, `sse`, or `websocket`.\n- 🚀 **10,000+"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" Server Scale Engine**: Dormant-by-default process pool with JIT worker activation and LRU idle proc"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ess reaper (maintains <100MB RAM even with 10k servers).\n- ⚡ **Sub-Millisecond BM25 Inverted Index**"},{"id":"p7s4","text":": Evaluates 20,000+ tool definitions across thousands of servers in <0.5ms.\n- 🎯 **Dynamic Token Budg"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"et Allocator**: Strict context window capping (e.g. max 1,500 tokens) with progressive schema disclo"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"sure.\n- 💾 **Two-Tier Schema Cache (L1/L2)**: Instant memory cache + disk snapshot eliminates `tools/"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"list` handshake delay on boots.\n- 📊 **Enterprise Telemetry**: High-resolution p50, p95, and p99 tool"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" latency histograms and metrics.\n- 📁 **Multi-Scope Configurations**: Automatically loads user global"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" (`~/.dsh/mcp.json`), project local (`.dsh/mcp.json`), and profile-level configurations.\n- 🛡️ **Exec"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ution Permissions**: Granular `allow`, `ask`, and `deny` permission rules for tool safety.\n- 🔒 **Ent"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"erprise Security Engine**: Automatic secrets redaction (API keys/bearer tokens), command injection g"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"uards, and path traversal defenses.\n- 🚦 **Circuit Breaker & Rate Limiting**: Fault tolerance prevent"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"s runaway loops and token quota exhaustion on failing servers.\n- 📜 **Security Audit Logging**: Struc"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"tured JSON logging of all tool invocations, permissions verdicts, and safety events.\n- 🔍 **Semantic "},{"id":"p7s15","text":"Tool Search**: TF-IDF token relevance scoring ensures only relevant tools are injected into prompt c"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"ontext.\n- 🗜️ **Context Spillover Guard**: Truncates massive outputs (>30k chars) and stores them as "},{"id":"p7s17","text":"local artifacts with structured previews.\n- 🛠️ **Automatic Tool Bridging**: Dynamically registers MC"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"P tools into the DSH tool registry with JSON Schema validation.\n- 📂 **Resource & Prompt Bridge**: Ex"},{"id":"p7s19","text":"poses MCP resources and prompt templates directly into agent context.\n- ⚡ **Resilient Execution**: I"},{"id":"p7s20","text":"solated server lifecycles, per-server timeout controls, and non-blocking error handling.\n- 🏷️ **Clea"},{"id":"p7s21","text":"n Namespacing**: Automatic tool name prefixing (`github_create_issue`, `postgres_query`) to avoid na"},{"id":"p7s22","text":"me collisions across servers.\n- 🧩 **Cordis Native**: Built directly on Cordis lifecycle hooks (`ctx."},{"id":"p7s23","text":"provide`, `ctx.on('ready')`, `ctx.on('dispose')`)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ⚡ 1-Line Docker Quickstart"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Launch DeepSeek Harness + MCP bridge + PostgreSQL + Filesystem with 1 command:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### In DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 💻 CLI Commands (`dsh-mcp`)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Manage MCP servers seamlessly from the terminal just like Claude Code:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Add the plugin to your `dsh.config.yaml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Programmatic Usage (Cordis API)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Development & Testing"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT © DeepSeek Harness Community"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 🤝 Contributing"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Contributions are warmly welcome! Whether you are reporting an issue, proposing an adapter, optimizi"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ng performance, or fixing a bug, please check out our Contributing Guide."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"1. Fork the Project\n2. Create your Feature Branch (`git checkout -b feat/AmazingFeature`)\n3. Commit "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"your Changes (`git commit -m 'feat: add some AmazingFeature'`)\n4. Push to the Branch (`git push orig"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"in feat/AmazingFeature`)\n5. Open a Pull Request"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 📄 License & Community"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Distributed under the **MIT License**. See `LICENSE` for more information."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Built with 💙 for the DeepSeek Harness community."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
